1
00:00:00,786 --> 00:00:01,956
(Leonard:)What?

2
00:00:03,388 --> 00:00:04,988
(Sheldon:)I was going to mention it
at the time,

3
00:00:05,157 --> 00:00:07,497
(Sheldon:)but then I thought, some day,

4
00:00:08,627 --> 00:00:11,267
(Sheldon:)this might be a teachable moment.

5
00:00:24,943 --> 00:00:27,153
Ahh!

6
00:00:34,586 --> 00:00:37,536
But I...?! You...?! How...?!

7
00:00:37,689 --> 00:00:39,029
What?!

8
00:00:44,196 --> 00:00:47,146
(Amy:)Sheldon, that was diabolical.

9
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:49,300
(Leonard:)I know.

10
00:00:50,836 --> 00:00:52,286
(Sheldon:)And it wasn't easy.

11
00:00:52,437 --> 00:00:56,117
(Sheldon:)Do you have any idea what it's like
to wait for years,

12
00:00:56,308 --> 00:00:58,878
(Sheldon:)and never know if you're going
to finally get satisfaction?

13
00:01:06,051 --> 00:01:07,321
(Lucy:)Wow.

14
00:01:07,486 --> 00:01:09,156
(Raj:)You're even prettier than Penny said.

15
00:01:09,321 --> 00:01:12,061
(Raj:)I can't believe a girl like you
doesn't have a boyfriend.

16
00:01:12,224 --> 00:01:13,294
(Leonard:)Well, I don't.

17
00:01:13,458 --> 00:01:15,568
(Raj:)I don't believe you.
You're lying to me!

18
00:01:16,561 --> 00:01:18,061
(Leonard:)What?

19
00:01:18,230 --> 00:01:20,640
(Raj:)It's okay. I have no morals,
and I'm desperately lonely.

20
00:01:20,799 --> 00:01:22,869
(Raj:)I'll be the other man if you want
a little something-something

21
00:01:23,035 --> 00:01:24,635
(Raj:)on the side.

22
00:01:24,803 --> 00:01:30,813
What is wrong with you?!

